  "notes": "anomaly-wine-engine provides a standalone Wine 11.16 / CrossOver 26.3 engine for Apple Silicon Macs running macOS 26 or newer, with DXMT as its only graphics backend. No WineD3D fallback: cxcompatdb terminates any process whose DXMT payload fails validation."
